  - multidimensional state
  - multi-actor system
  - resource dynamics
  - expectation stock
  - expectation flow
  - microeconomic equilibrium
  - macroeconomic adjustment
  - nominal-real structure
  - action
  - measurement proxy
  - social dynamics
